<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador authorities have summoned seven suspects for plotting the murder of a political candidate, showing continued organized-crime violence. U.S. prosecutors have charged the son of former President and four others with cocaine trafficking, linking Ecuadorian actors to international drug routes. A Polish drug kingpin was arrested in Ecuador for a cross-border cocaine ring, and a major Ecuadorian cocaine and weapons trafficking network was busted in New York. The U.S. military is assisting Ecuador in its first land operation against cartels, and a magnitude 4.7 earthquake struck off Ecuador with no tsunami warning. The conflict recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOUzd0aF8xNFFqVlY5ZVJERHRHbzF1XzlmMTkyYWF6T001MmotY1JxUGtYY1JxVE5NdVQwQjFjbV9UOG53TDZpV3FON25QVnBnc3A2b2lfbzB1aWx4cmN5dnRnS0EyYk9lQmxNb21uVlROT3g4aVF0ZHRhVU4xUEhJMWdET0tscXdTX2kyOGdhZVpEZTBjRDZvVlhJOEhfUXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNaERKZEtTR0JvM1BYcTFlMFFDTlRsWTJuU01vbXdNSEdNSHFkY0RxVkxvMDFXTUJ3VlBNU19wRHNLUVJlNkN4MGVtWThaQlZEYjFIYTdGazFoOFdLNmdxbmFyMm5WV0FRaXV5WHdfejJWOFgyanZ5QnptM0o4bk9rWDlrRzVfV1BEMC1fLVdvT0ZFXy1vUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQc2s1cXUxOGhTYnZhTkNvOTJ1SFRwanhEMzc1ZkRnRnZfTzk1ZFJFNElUWTZCcnZOY1NicDZsY3k0bHdWUkVndlVONXJjbmdFQXZlZVhKTWsyWFZyMTUtWnBjQWFYZ0FGNnZzODZzLXhPTEFBSGVEdVY1QXNUOU1KQ3JVY3hZOTBLc3hxc2szQm1VV2VzLVUzdFFDWS1JOW84TXFLT0JMelNGbERIMmYxM21aa3AtUlZTYV8yVVpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;SC Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE9FLXpGTHN5UW5nVUxCNHRBcGxkeTIweW5DeEVKaDUtQkFSa2pyV05jUWtDa1NWNWYyTzE3OG4wblBiT2M2OFhENWJCdFVBTTV6dkVKaGpJZHM2MTNUb2